  "optional_assembly_plan": "1..16 ordered groups: id, name(max50), parts(exclusive exhaustive ids), direction(unit final-to-start), distance(0..300mm). Each group inserts as a rigid unit; parent group cannot follow child group. Local group assembly uses original per-part steps. Optional batches: ordered nonempty arrays partitioning group parts, simultaneous within batch, sequential between batches. Internal step paths retained; exact seven-pose batch checks include moving pairs and prior installed batches. Optional type=body identifies detachable shell groups; view filters do not alter checks.",
